      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The wind is still a little chilly, isn't it?\r\nFor the lightly dressed children, let's give them\r\na brief moment to be wrapped in warm air.",
        "Jp" : "まだ少し風が冷たいでしょう\r\n薄着の子たちには、ほんの短い間だけ\r\n暖かい空気をまとえるようにしてあげる"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 816158,
      "MsgType" : 0,
